; equality_charge_before_unset_model: EQUALITY is charged its expansion
; before it reads its model register, so an unset model under an exhausted
; budget raises MemoryLimitExceeded rather than UnsetRegister.
;
; spec/xqvm/SPEC.md orders pops, then the allocation charge, then
; validation, and states that the charge sized from the register reads it
; only as a model and is zero for an unset one, while the charge is still
; paid before the register is discriminated. The expansion itself is sized
; from the indices operand: two terms, 2x32 + 1x48 = 112 bytes. The four
; VECPUSHes spend the budget of 64 bytes exactly, so the charge is refused
; before r0 is read.

VECI r1
PUSH 0
VECPUSH r1
PUSH 1
VECPUSH r1       ; indices = [0, 1]
VECI r2
PUSH 1
VECPUSH r2
PUSH 1
VECPUSH r2       ; coeffs = [1, 1]; 64 bytes: the whole budget
PUSH 1           ; target
PUSH 1           ; penalty
EQUALITY r0 r1 r2  ; r0 was never written
HALT
